        "name": "envirocar",
        "author": "Christoph Stasch",
        "url": null,
        "notes": "The enviroCar dataset is an open data set containing anonymized tracks of car measurements collected by citizens. Anyone can contribute data using an OBDII-Adapter and an Android smartphone. More information about the project can be found at: http://envirocar.org\r\n\r\nBy default, the data set is available in JSON through a RESTful server API, but a SPARQL endpoint is also available. Several other dataformats (e.g. csv) are also accessible. ",
